pecial cosmetics.\nThis game is constantly undergoing development and receiving updates to add more cosmetics, maps, and experiences.\nPlease let me know what to improve on by leaving a review and commenting on what could be better!\ud83d\ude0a\nContact Email: monkeyhavoccreator@gmail.com", "short_description": "Monkey Havoc is a 'Gorilla Tag' and 'Capuchin' fan game, made so that you and your friends can freely explore the world around you. \nIf you need to contact us about any user concerns, email here: monkeyhavoccreator@gmail.com\n\nHave Fun!\n- The Creator of Monkey Havoc"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monke-jumpers-website/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monke-jumpers-website/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "KrakinProductioms", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monke-jumpers-website/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25220072740920478"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974497_2205835346460087_3419820071698206451_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t77r_qyy_hMQ7kNvwE8Y7v_&_nc_oc=AdrDCoGP3VR_vNVAsr06Zy3YZ6-2LfaZFBwrlqLq8